{
  "id": "1CH.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Ŋakiro A Ŋirwa 24",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epite ŋolo atyakatyakatere ŋisacaradotin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lo epite ŋolo atyakatyakatere ŋipapae ka Aron: Arae lu ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa: Nadab, Abiu ka Eleasar ta Isamar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu Nadab ka Abiu totwaka eriŋa papa kec eyari, mam ŋidwe ŋulusapa apotu ikes touruut; aŋun, apotu Eleasar ka Isamar toruwor ŋisacaradotin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakiŋarakina kaapei ka Sadok lopapait ke Eleasar ka Aimelek lopapait ka Isamar, abu Daudi totyak ikes toruwor ŋatukon, ikotere eboonokin akitiya apaki ŋina emaikina kitiyaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna aponere toryamunae ŋikarikok ŋulu alalak eyakasi lopapae ke Eleasar akilo alopapae ka Isamar, aponi totyakae ikes ikona: Kituruworoe ŋitomon ka ŋikanikapei ŋulu arae ŋipapae ke Eleasar ŋikapolokinitok ŋikalya a ŋituŋa ke Eleasar, kituruworoe ŋikanikauni ŋikapolokinitok ŋikalya a ŋituŋa ka Isamar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi ikes totyakae emam ŋini ariit neni a ŋice, kisitiyae akilamilam, anerae amaikina toryamunae ŋikarikok ŋulu ka akibois a ŋina asegan ka ŋikarikok ŋulu ke etic ka Akuj alopapae ke Eleasar ka Isamar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekaran Semaia lokoku a Nesaniel ŋolo arae Elepait, kigir ŋirorwa kec alokiŋaren erwosit ka ŋikapolok lu: Sadok ŋolo arae esacaradoti, Aimelek lokoku ka Abiasar ka ŋikapolok ŋulu a ŋikalya a ŋituŋa a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi. Tolemunae ekal epei aneni a ŋituŋa ke Eleasar ka epei aneni a ŋituŋa a Isamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akilamilamakinet ŋina esyaunan, abu min neni a Yeoyarib, ŋina a ŋaarei neni a Yedaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋauni neni ka Arim, ŋina a ŋaomwon neni a Seorim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋakan neni a Maliciya, ŋina a ŋakanikapei neni a Mijamin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋakanikaarei neni ka Akos, ŋina a ŋakanikauni neni ka Abiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋakanikaomwon neni a Yesua, ŋina a ŋatomon neni a Sekania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomon kaapei neni ke Eliasib, ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋaarei neni a Yakim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋauni neni a Upa, ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋaomwon neni a Yesebeab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋakan neni a Biliga, ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋakanikapei neni a Imer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋakanikaarei neni ke Esir, ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋakanikauni neni ka Apises, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋakanikaomwon neni a Pesaia, ŋina a ŋatomoniarei neni a Yesikel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomoniarei ka apei neni a Yakin, ŋina a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaarei neni a Gamul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋina a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋauni neni a Delaia ka ŋina a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon neni a Masia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋol epite ŋolo esibakitere ikes itiyaete apaki ŋina elomaryata Kai ke Ekapolon, lopite ŋolo alimunitotor ŋikisila a papaa kec ka Aron aŋuna kec, ikwapei ecikitor Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋilepi ŋuluce",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋipapae a Lepi ŋuluce lu ŋulu aseunitae: Aponi toseunae alodwe ka Amiram a ŋulusapa Subael; toseunae alodwe a Subael a ŋulusapa Yedeia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a Reabia, aponi toseunae Isia lokoku keŋ ŋolokiyae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alopapae a Isarites, aponi toseunae Selomos; alodwe a Selomos a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Yaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe ke Eburon a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae lu: Ŋolo esyaunan Yeria, ŋolo a ŋiarei Amaria, ŋolo a ŋiuni Yaasiel ka ŋolo a ŋiomwon Yekamean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe a Usiel a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae lokoku keŋ Mika; aneni a ŋidwe a Mika a ŋulusapa aponi toseunae Samir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni alokaato a Mika, aponi toseunae Isia; aneni a ŋidwe a Isia a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Sakariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋidwe a Merari a ŋulusapa, aponi toseunae Mali ka Musi. Aneni a Yasia, aponi toseunae lokoku keŋ Beno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a ŋipapae a Merari aponi toseunae ŋidwe a Yasia lu: Beno, Soam ka Sakur ta Ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a Mali, aponi toseunae Eleasar, amamukar Eleasar ikoku ŋinisapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a Kis aponi toseunae Yerameel lokoku keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneni a Musi, aponi toseunae Mali ka Eder ta Yerimos. Arae ŋul Ŋilepei imarunitae a ŋikalya kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:31"
          },
