        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes daŋ kisitiyata akilamilam lopite ŋolo esitiyaata ŋikaitotoi kec ŋidwe ka Aron. Apotu ikes kitiyata ŋun alokiŋaren erwosit Daudi ka alokiŋaren Sadok ka Aimelek ta ŋikarikok a ŋikalya a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi. Apotu ikes kitiyata ŋun eriyan neni a ŋikalya a ŋikaitotoi kec a ŋulu apolok ka ŋulucicik.",
